		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — Blanket an area in vision-blocking smoke.</em></p><p><strong>2 Actions.</strong> Range 6, Line 6 or Blast 4. The area fills with thick smoke for 1 minute or until dispersed. It obscures vision and can't be seen through.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Affects all adjacent spaces as well.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You can see through smoke and other gases.</p><hr><p><em>[M] Gadget activation costs 1 Toolbelt scrap (2 total for the Toolbelt upgrade); the passive is always active. Scrap cost and activation are tracked by the module.</em></p>",
